OL,3,GNEWSAFamily 'in hell' as critically ill
OL,4,Ababy stuck abroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a baby who fell ill on
OL,7,Fholiday and cannot get home has said
OL,8,F"every day is frightening and
OL,9,Funcertain".
OL,11,FSofia was visiting family in Hong Kong
OL,12,Fin July when her nine-month-old son
OL,13,FMatthew contracted influenza A. He
OL,14,Fsuffered three cardiac arrests, leaving
OL,15,Fhim unconscious and on a ventilator.
OL,17,FHis medical condition and the high cost
OL,18,Fof returning him home to Mansfield,
OL,19,FNottinghamshire, have left the family
OL,20,F"living on earth but in hell",
OL,21,Faccording to charity Lia's Wings.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
